      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Next: betrayal in Kyoto",
      "narration": "Next time, we go back to Japan. Remember Nobunaga, the man who won at Okehazama? Twenty-two years later, he was the most powerful man in the country. Then one night, at a temple in Kyoto, one of his own generals turned on him.",
      "word_count": 43
    },
    {
